# Use with IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client.
# Set host and apiKey locally; NEVER commit a populated secret.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = CHANGE_ME_IN_LOCAL_COPY

### Health check
GET {{host}}/hello

### List rules
GET {{host}}/rules
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Devices
GET {{host}}/devices
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Preview (replace ID with real Sensor ID)
POST {{host}}/rules/preview
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId": 1, "value": 1}

### Trigger once (replace ID with real Sensor ID)
POST {{host}}/events
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId": 1, "value": 1}

### Process queued events
POST {{host}}/events/process
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Rule execution summary
GET {{host}}/summary
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Simulated execution log
GET {{host}}/logs
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Durable SQL execution log
GET {{host}}/logs/details
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
